  "tourNextAction": "Next",
  "tourMyEventsTitle": "My Events",
  "tourMyEventsDescription": "Here you can see the events you registered for, the meetings you scheduled with other students, and track your participation.",
  "tourPointsTitle": "My Points",
  "tourPointsDescription": "This is the number of points you have earned so far. You can earn points by attending events, meeting other students, and taking part in other activities in the app, then use them to redeem benefits.",
  "tourChampionsTitle": "Monthly Champions",
  "tourChampionsDescription": "Earn points, climb the ranking, and reach the top! Here you can track your position and see who leads the monthly ranking. At the end of each month, the three students with the most points receive bonus points.",
  "tourSurveysTitle": "Surveys",
  "tourSurveysDescription": "Share what you think and earn points too! Short surveys will appear here for you to answer easily, and you will receive points for every survey you complete.",
  "tourAccessibilityTitle": "Accessibility Button",
  "tourAccessibilityDescription": "Open accessibility options here and adapt the app display to your needs. You can drag the accessibility button anywhere convenient on the screen, and remove or restore it at any time from the app settings.",
  "tourMatchesNavTitle": "Meet & Connect",
  "tourMatchesNavDescription": "Meet the students around you on campus, discover what you have in common, and arrange to meet on campus! Met up? Scan each other during the meeting and earn points together. Tap here to continue.",
  "tourScanNavTitle": "Scan",
  "tourBenefitsNavTitle": "Benefits",
  "tourTapToContinue": "Tap the highlighted button to continue.",
  "tourCompatibilityTitle": "Compatibility Percentage",
  "tourCompatibilityDescription": "A compatibility percentage appears next to each student and is calculated from things you have in common, such as fields of study, interests, and languages. The higher the percentage, the more characteristics you share.",
  "tourChatTitle": "Chat",
  "tourChatDescription": "Here you can chat with and get to know other students. Using the (+) button in the chat, you can schedule a meeting that will be saved in ‘My Events’. During the meeting, an option will open to scan each other to confirm that you met, and after confirmation you will receive the meeting points.",
  "tourStudentProfileTitle": "Profile",
  "tourStudentProfileDescription": "Here you can get to know the student a little better and see the details they chose to share on their profile, such as their field of study, languages, interests, and additional information about them.",
  "tourReportTitle": "Report a User",
  "tourReportDescription": "It is important to know this option: if a user behaves inappropriately, makes you feel uncomfortable, or there is an issue our team should know about, you can report it here. The report will be sent to the system team for review and handling.",
  "tourScanCameraTitle": "Event QR Scan",
  "tourScanCameraDescription": "Arrived at an event? Scan the QR code here to confirm your attendance and receive points. This camera is for event scanning only. Meetings with students use a separate scan that opens automatically inside the meeting at its scheduled time. You can find your scheduled meetings in ‘My Events’.",
  "tourStudentIdTitle": "Student Number",
  "tourStudentIdDescription": "This is your personal identification number in the app. If you missed the QR scan at an event or there was a scanning problem, you can give this number to the event host so they can add you manually.",
  "tourBenefitsPageTitle": "Benefits",
  "tourBenefitsPageDescription": "It’s time to enjoy the points you’ve earned! Here you can see available benefits, read their details, check how many points are required, and choose the benefit you want to redeem.",
  "tourWalletTitle": "My Wallet",
  "tourTapWalletDescription": "Tap the wallet button to continue.",
  "tourWalletDescription": "Every benefit you redeem is waiting for you here. In the wallet you can find the benefits you chose to redeem and open each benefit’s digital card. When you arrive at the business, show the digital card and enjoy your benefit.",
  "tourProfileTitle": "Profile",
  "tourProfileDescription": "This is your personal C2C profile. Here you can view and update the details you want other students to know about you. You can also change the app language and accessibility button, and view open surveys and the terms of use in the settings below.",
  "tourReplayAction": "Replay step-by-step guide",
  "surveyAnswerRequired": "Please answer all questions before submitting.",
  "tourProfileButtonTitle": "Profile",
  "tourProfileButtonDescription": "Here you can get to know the student a little better and see the details they chose to share on their profile, such as their field of study, languages, interests, and additional information about them.",
  "demoChatBlockTitle": "Block a user",
  "demoChatBlockMessage": "You can block this user from here. Once blocked, they won't be able to send you messages and you won't be able to send them messages either. You can block and unblock at any time by tapping the button.",
  "demoChatMeetingTitle": "Schedule a meeting",
  "demoChatMeetingMessage": "From here you can arrange a meeting with the student you're chatting with. Set up a meeting, meet on campus and earn points together! A first meeting with a new student earns each of you 25 points, a second meeting with the same student 20 points, and a third meeting 10 points. Please note: you can arrange one meeting per day with the same student, and up to 5 meetings with different students on the same day.",
